                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I started off just wacking it, then my friends started watching, then my hand caught fire, then I was in outer space. Good game, definitely worth the pricetag. Easy to learn how to play, but completing the game seems like a challenge. Make sure your space is clear before playing, as the game picks up fast and you'll be swinging that hammer all over the place! Whether you are looking for a fun VR experience for yourself or an intuitive game to show people new to VR, this is the game for you!",
